WEBVTT

00:26:00.246 --> 00:26:03.871
our grief are our hard experiences,

00:26:04.246 --> 00:26:07.913
gives those experiences or
those emotions power,

00:26:08.746 --> 00:26:12.454
but giving language to hard
things gives us power.

00:26:14.954 --> 00:26:18.788
Yeah, that's you know, that's so true
when when we can name an emotion,

00:26:18.996 --> 00:26:23.663
it at least allows us to analyze it or
to reflect on it and to control it

00:26:23.663 --> 00:26:27.288
a little bit, because we realize we have
choices about what we call it.

00:26:27.579 --> 00:26:30.704
And when I do something wrong, as
you pointed out so many times,